    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>/*主播*/</span></strong><span> 大仑乙（萌仔）、大仑丙（西北）</span></p><span></span><p><span>友情链接：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60ed46f15294f153198c64ca" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60ed46f15294f153198c64ca"><span>火象三傻妙妙屋</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/670a97d5db2cf82757bb2c2e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/670a97d5db2cf82757bb2c2e"><span>开始游戏</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>这一期是</span><del><span>骗人</span></del><span>游戏节目，欢迎大家边听边一起猜猜看。</span></p><span></span><p><span>萌仔的题目：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、我曾经因为喜欢某个偶像，而自费拍摄了她的同款打歌MV。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、我曾经给一部当红作品的角色配音，还收到了玩家写的情书。</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、我有一次全裸蒸桑拿的时候，有一个帅气的小哥闯了进来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>西北的题目：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、我之前gap了一年，在gap期间认真学习过如何当虚拟主播。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、我曾经参加过某头部播客的录制，结束后因为对当天的发言不满意而两天没有睡好。</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、距离我答应我朋友看机器人之梦已经过去超过八个月了，截止录制节目当天还没有看到第30分钟。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/*本期节目您将听到*/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a> 萌仔第一题问答环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a> 萌仔第二题问答环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a> 萌仔第三题问答环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1016">16:56</a> 萌仔的揭晓环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2213">36:53</a> 西北第一题问答环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2332">38:52</a> 西北第二题问答环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">41:49</a> 西北第三题问答环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2635">43:55</a> 西北的揭晓环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4942">01:22:22</a> ED：蚂蚁世界乐队 - 真假</span></p><span></span><p><strong><